p.png","https://www.greatstonesoftware.co.uk/storage/gallery/cropped/devexpress-winforms-spreadsheet.png","https://www.greatstonesoftware.co.uk/storage/gallery/cropped/devexpress-wpf-diagram-desktop-hd.png","https://www.greatstonesoftware.co.uk/storage/gallery/cropped/devexpress-dashboard-sales-desktop.png","https://www.greatstonesoftware.co.uk/storage/gallery/cropped/DevExpress-CodeRush-Debug-Visualizer.png","https://www.greatstonesoftware.co.uk/storage/gallery/cropped/devexpress-web-reporting-user-designer.png"],"sourceUrl":"https://www.greatstonesoftware.co.uk/devexpress/devexpress-universal"}'::jsonb, '{"metaTitle":"DevExpress Universal | DevExpress | Greatstone International","metaDescription":"The DevExpress Universal Subscription is the ultimate developer component suite on the market. It includes over 600 UI Controls and more.","socialImage":""}'::jsonb, now());
