s://www.greatstonesoftware.co.uk/storage/gallery/cropped/devexpress-vcl-email-client.png"],"sourceUrl":"https://www.greatstonesoftware.co.uk/devexpress/devexpress-vcl"}'::jsonb, '{"metaTitle":"DevExpress VCL | Delphi and C++ Builder Components","metaDescription":"DevExpress VCL helps developers build stylish UX, produce high-impact line of business solutions & leverage their VCL skillset to build next-gen applications.","socialImage":""}'::jsonb, now());
