ped/devexpress-winforms-map-control-office-app.png","https://www.greatstonesoftware.co.uk/storage/gallery/cropped/DevExpress-WinForms-Scheduler.png"],"sourceUrl":"https://www.greatstonesoftware.co.uk/devexpress/devexpress-winForms"}'::jsonb, '{"metaTitle":"DevExpress WinForms | Windows Forms Solutions","metaDescription":"The DevExpress WinForms subscription has every tool a developer would need to develop comprehensive and intuitive corporate solutions for Windows Forms. ","socialImage":""}'::jsonb, now());
