tion.png","https://www.greatstonesoftware.co.uk/storage/gallery/cropped/devexpress-wpf-win10-navigation-tablet.png"],"sourceUrl":"https://www.greatstonesoftware.co.uk/devexpress/devexpress-wpf"}'::jsonb, '{"metaTitle":"DevExpress WPF | Create Business Applications","metaDescription":"DevExpress WPF from Greatstone International allows you to create apps that mimic MSOffice and Windows with 120+ Controls and Libraries.","socialImage":""}'::jsonb, now());
